1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Hi, I'm Andres. I build speed-to-lead automations
for home service businesses.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Someone fills out your website form at 8 PM
while you're on a job or with your family.

3
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:25,000
If nobody answers for hours, they may
call the next company on the list.

4
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:35,000
With what I build, that person gets a friendly text back
in under a minute, from your business number,

5
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:45,000
with their name and the service they asked for.
And an email with the same details.

6
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:52,000
At the same time the lead is logged
in your Google Sheet or CRM,

7
00:00:52,000 --> 00:01:00,000
and you get an alert on your phone, so you can
call them back while they're still interested.

8
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:10,000
On the Pro setup, if you miss a call, the caller
gets a text right away asking how you can help.

9
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:20,000
A missed call doesn't have to be a lost conversation.

10
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:30,000
If a lead goes quiet, two short follow-ups go out on their own.

11
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:40,000
You approve every message before it goes live,
and every text includes a way to opt out.

12
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:55,000
When the job is done and paid, the customer
gets a review request with your Google link.

13
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:05,000
Everything runs on accounts you own: your form,
your texting number, your sheet, your automation tool.

14
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:15,000
I never ask for your passwords; we set it up
together on a screen share. No mass texting,
no cold calls, no AI calling your customers.

15
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:25,000
Starter is 250 dollars one-time: instant text and email,
logging and owner alerts.

16
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:32,000
Pro is 400: adds missed-call text-back,
follow-ups and review requests.

17
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:40,000
The optional care plan is 100 dollars a month
for up to five changes.

18
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:52,000
You pay half to start and the balance
once you see it working.

19
00:02:52,000 --> 00:03:00,000
Want something custom? Let's start
with a free discovery call. Send me a message.
